WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:00.940
What's up guys!

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:01.840
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:02.915
As we mentiond last week

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.440
We have a big surprise for you guys

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.800
Surprise

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.960
We have just launched our own mobile game!

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.140
Infinite Ping Pong

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.260
It's a free app

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.560
And you can download it on both Apple and Android

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.020
The game is made by our friend Johannes Linnama

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.080
Who has done the whole development by himself

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.200
Go check it out, it's really fun!

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.000
The idea of the game

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.420
is to get as many shots on table as possible

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.480
The opponent will never miss

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.540
Move your player by clicking on the screen

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.920
And you hit by swiping

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.120
The longer your swipe is

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.440
the harder your shot is

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.840
And the harder you hit, the slower the ball will come back

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.660
You can even hit harder by dashing into the shots

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.480
One of the coolest features in the game

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.540
is the leaderboard

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.680
So you can compare your results

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.640
to ours and your friends

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.460
When you get to a higher level

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:59.120
You can unlock new items, maps, characters and challenges

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.820
The game starts here

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.220
At the Pongfinity Hall

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.820
But as you level up

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.435
You get to use the earned coins

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.760
to unlock new maps

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.260
So you can change the background on which you play

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.760
There is obviously three characters that you can unlock in the game:

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.680
Me, Miikka and Otto

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:18.780
And it's fun that all of the characters have different stats

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.060
So you have to choose which character you play with

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:22.020
And of course

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.220
Inspired by our popular Challenge Pongfinity series

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:28.920
There is also tasks and challenges that you can complete in the game

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.840
It's a really cool feature that brings another dimension to the game

00:01:32.865 --> 00:01:34.560
The game is free to download

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:38.360
and you don't need to buy anything to get higher scores or progress in the game

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.940
But there is in-app purchases that will speed up the process

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.340
If you decide to buy something in-game

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.660
you will be supporting us and our channel

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:48.380
And if you are good enough

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.720
There will be a little surprise for you

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:52.060
at score 100

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.720
I have never reached that far

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.560
I have!

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.600
Go and download the game from the links that are in the description

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.600
Go and try to beat our hiscores!

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.280
Until next time!

